<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The calculator that opens on the amount of a movement.

  It was a white dialog with grey rectangles and a black-on-white display,
  while the quick entry beside it has a dark keypad with round keys. Same
  gesture, two different programs. This is now the quick entry's keypad with
  the arithmetic added: same circles, same dark ground, the figure large at
  the top.

  Every id is the one the calculator code already looks for.

